Subject: Tight-store analysis walks forward

What this does
  Tight-store analysis walks forward.

Why we need it
  `regvm_tight_store_def` rescanned forward from the block start on every store, quadratic on store-heavy blocks.

What it adds
  Threads `prev`/`prev2` from the caller's in-order walk into `regvm_tight_store_def` instead of recomputing them.

Needs a bytecode version bump
  No.
